* `TwoPiece.lean` — the two-piece bound of the winding span: the connector-free datum plus a path
  connected intersection give `W(A ∪ B) ≤ W A ⊔ W B`, and its vanishing form.
* `SignSplit.lean` — the sign split of a loop for **any** pair containing the two closed halves
  (`alternatingPartitionDataWeak_of_finite_crossing_of_subset`).
* `CollarPair.lean` — the residual of the area as the existence of a **collar pair**
